Two files are redistributed, each carried unmodified:

    priv/bnf/SyntaxBNF-v9.3.1.6
        The TPTP syntax BNF, version 9.3.1.6, attributed to the TPTP and taken from
        https://github.com/TPTPWorld/SyntaxBNF at commit 3568c275 of 2026-10-12:
        https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TPTPWorld/SyntaxBNF/3568c27532fb9635e9ea4454ec439c6f549c8279/SyntaxBNF-v9.3.1.6
        sha256 716d494d6c0aca2c6305edd580107e5f6cf3f1faab457d72fed6accbec38d8d7

    priv/bnf/SZSOntology.bnf
        The BNF of the three SZS ontologies, licensed CC BY 4.0 by its repository
        (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/; see the repository's LICENSE)
        and taken from https://github.com/TPTPWorld/SZSOntologies at commit
        934403fd of 2026-09-29:
        https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TPTPWorld/SZSOntologies/934403fde10748dfa02a5fb404b5619d0ca84068/BNF/SZSOntology.bnf
        sha256 640cd71710935d41e16914e7d577adf7a4f6c647f4aaa6a1e353b02b0b338c5f

They are vendored so that installing this package needs no network access. Nothing
in this repository edits them. The files under lib/, src/ and test/support/ that are
derived from them are produced by `mix tptp.gen` and are regenerated rather than
hand-maintained.

The repository file of the syntax BNF is the source of the page published at
https://tptp.org/UserDocs/TPTPLanguage/SyntaxBNF.html, and the two are not the same
text under the same version number: at the time of writing the page still lists
`unknown` among the alternatives of <source> and still carries the <status_value>
rule, both of which the repository file has dropped, the latter in favour of the SZS
BNF. The repository is the maintained copy and is the one vendored.

A further piece of TPTP material is carried without being redistributed as a file.
lib/tptp/szs/page.ex transcribes what the SZS ontology page at
https://szs.tptp.org publishes and the SZS BNF does not: the mnemonic of each of
the 112 values, and the description of each, the last of these quoted from the page
in the TPTP's own words. The transcription is maintained by hand and was last
checked against the page on 2026-09-10. It is offered as attributed verbatim
quotation of the published text; no wording is altered.

The SZS ontology moved to https://szs.tptp.org during 2026; the former address,
https://tptp.org/UserDocs/SZSOntology, now serves a notice pointing there.

Note that the BNF served by SeeTPTP under Category=Documents lags both of the above:
at the time of writing it is version 9.3.0.4.

